    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the branch. Close the loop. Escape alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreality: Beyond Worlds is a handcrafted sci-fi exploration and extraction game with surreal horror elements. Step into unstable pocket dimensions known as <strong>branches</strong>\u00a0to scavenge, investigate, and survive. Your mission? Close each branch before it mutates beyond your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Earth but something else is bleeding through. A twisted dimension has begun to leak into our reality, carving out unstable pockets of warped space known as <strong>branches</strong>. These zones defy logic: broken physics, melted time, impossible architecture, and echoes of things that never should exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left unchecked, the bleed mutates. It spreads. It consumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whole towns vanish overnight. People, places gone without a trace, absorbed into the unreality... SomniumCorp has developed the technology to enter these branches and shut them down before they devour everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of their agents. Step in, close the loop, and get out before the branch swallows you too.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the branch. Close the loop. Escape alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreality: Beyond Worlds is a handcrafted sci-fi exploration and extraction game with surreal horror elements. Step into unstable pocket dimensions known as <strong>branches</strong>\u00a0to scavenge, investigate, and survive. Your mission? Close each branch before it mutates beyond your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Earth but something else is bleeding through. A twisted dimension has begun to leak into our reality, carving out unstable pockets of warped space known as <strong>branches</strong>. These zones defy logic: broken physics, melted time, impossible architecture, and echoes of things that never should exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left unchecked, the bleed mutates. It spreads. It consumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whole towns vanish overnight. People, places gone without a trace, absorbed into the unreality... SomniumCorp has developed the technology to enter these branches and shut them down before they devour everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of their agents. Step in, close the loop, and get out before the branch swallows you too.</p>",
    "short_description": "Close the rifts, survive the horrors beyond reality, and escape before the branch collapses. Unreality: Beyond Worlds is a multiplayer co-op survival horror where every contract is a fight against the unknown.",
